  {
    "n": 5,
    "mode": "native",
    "native": "<div class=\"slide-native sm-skill sm-check\" style=\"--accent:var(--aws-blue);\" data-correct=\"B\" data-multi=\"\" data-rationale=\"The health check grace period tells Auto Scaling to wait a specified duration before checking the health status of a newly launched instance. Setting this value to longer than the 3-minute initialization time prevents Auto Scaling from terminating instances that are still starting up. During the grace period, the instance is not terminated regardless of health check status.\" data-judge=\"{&quot;prompt&quot;: &quot;Question 4: Instances replaced too early&quot;, &quot;options&quot;: [&quot;Increase the ALB health check interval to 5 minutes.&quot;, &quot;Configure a health check grace period on the Auto Scaling group that exceeds the application initialization time.&quot;, &quot;Set the deregistration delay on the target group to 5 minutes.&quot;, &quot;Add a lifecycle hook to the Auto Scaling group that pauses the instance in a Pending:Wait state indefinitely.&quot;], &quot;answer&quot;: &quot;Configure a health check grace period on the Auto Scaling group that exceeds the application initialization time.&quot;, &quot;why&quot;: &quot;The health check grace period tells Auto Scaling to wait a specified duration before checking the health status of a newly launched instance. Setting this value to longer than the 3-minute initialization time prevents Auto Scaling from terminating instances that are still starting up. During the grace period, the instance is not terminated regardless of health check status.&quot;, &quot;explanations&quot;: {&quot;A&quot;: &quot;Increasing the health check interval changes how often the ALB checks instance health. However, the instance could still fail multiple consecutive checks during the 3-minute initialization period and be deregistered. The health check interval alone does not account for initialization time.&quot;, &quot;B&quot;: &quot;The health check grace period tells Auto Scaling to wait a specified duration before checking the health status of a newly launched instance. Setting this value to longer than the 3-minute initialization time prevents Auto Scaling from terminating instances that are still starting up. During the grace period, the instance is not terminated regardless of health check status.&quot;, &quot;C&quot;: &quot;The deregistration delay controls how long the load balancer waits before completing deregistration of an instance being removed. It applies to instances being removed from the target group, not instances being added. This setting does not prevent premature termination during initialization.&quot;, &quot;D&quot;: &quot;A lifecycle hook can pause an instance before it enters service. However, configuring it to wait indefinitely requires manual intervention to complete the lifecycle action. This does not automatically transition the instance to InService after initialization and creates operational overhead.&quot;}, &quot;sources&quot;: [&quot;https://docs.aws.amazon.com/autoscaling/ec2/userguide/health-checks-overview.html&quot;]}\" data-sources=\"[&quot;https://docs.aws.amazon.com/autoscaling/ec2/userguide/health-checks-overview.html&quot;]\"><div class=\"kicker\">SESSION 1 &middot; KNOWLEDGE CHECK &middot; QUESTION 4 of 5</div><h2>Check yourself <span class=\"sm-check-hint\">click an option</span></h2><p class=\"sm-check-q\">Question 4: Instances replaced too early</p><div class=\"sm-opts\"><button class=\"sm-opt\" data-ltr=\"A\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"sm-opt-l\">A</span><span class=\"sm-opt-t\">Increase the ALB health check interval to 5 minutes.</span><span class=\"sm-opt-m\"></span></button><button class=\"sm-opt\" data-ltr=\"B\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"sm-opt-l\">B</span><span class=\"sm-opt-t\">Configure a health check grace period on the Auto Scaling group that exceeds the application initialization time.</span><span class=\"sm-opt-m\"></span></button><button class=\"sm-opt\" data-ltr=\"C\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"sm-opt-l\">C</span><span class=\"sm-opt-t\">Set the deregistration delay on the target group to 5 minutes.</span><span class=\"sm-opt-m\"></span></button><button class=\"sm-opt\" data-ltr=\"D\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"sm-opt-l\">D</span><span class=\"sm-opt-t\">Add a lifecycle hook to the Auto Scaling group that pauses the instance in a Pending:Wait state indefinitely.</span><span class=\"sm-opt-m\"></span></button></div><div class=\"sm-check-fb\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"sm-source\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-question\"></i> Knowledge check &middot; Content Review Session 1</div></div>",
